  "title": "Unnameable types stay auto",
  "summary": "Lambdas, dependent types, structured bindings and types the declaration cannot name are not expanded",
  "prose": "A type cannot be named where it is local to another function, a member type the declaration has no access to, or the type of `sizeof` with no standard name for it declared yet (MSVC compatibility declares `size_t` implicitly).",
